# tally 2.2.1 (#208, 208.5), L §8.2 One read set ("a hole lists them like a value"): q2, the flows of spend refused
# RUN-ORDER, rests on spend's day, add_business(…, holidays), so it lists assumed: the card names no holiday, as
# q_decide does. tally 2.2 listed it under q_decide only (the 2.1.8 review's g4fix/agent/c_base.tally).
=== c_base.tally
model decide
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's base for M1's decision-order fixtures (invented): it loads and answers clean; each fixture of codes/m1/edits.tsv changes one line"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input holidays: calendar

input horizon: date

input lag: int

input month_start: date

input save_cap: money PLN

input spend_cap: money PLN

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place savings: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

input oday: date

input ocap: money PLN

move save: transfers
  on add_business(month_start, lag, holidays)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount min(save_cap, bal(konto))

move spend: transfers
  on add_business(month_start, lag, holidays)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to world amount min(spend_cap, bal(konto))

ask q_decide: bal(konto, horizon), bal(savings, horizon)
ask q2: flows(spend, 2026-01..2026-12)
ask q3: bal(other, horizon)

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  holidays = calendar(weekends [sat, sun]) assumed "the card names no holiday" "the card"
  horizon = 2026-12-31 "the card"
  lag = 10 "the card"
  month_start = 2026-04-01 "the card"
  save_cap = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  spend_cap = 50.00 PLN assumed "spend guessed" "the card"
  oday = 2026-05-05 assumed "oday guessed" "the card"
  ocap = 5.00 PLN assumed "ocap guessed" "the card"
  opening[other] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"

move omv: transfers
  on oday
  leg cash from world to other amount ocap
ask q4: bal(konto, 2026-04-30), bal(other, 2026-06-01)
=== expect q2 q_decide
q2: refused: RUN-ORDER decisions save and spend read each other on 2026-04-15
  assumed: the card names no holiday (holidays)
  cut 2026-03-01
q_decide: (refused: RUN-ORDER decisions save and spend read each other on 2026-04-15, refused: RUN-ORDER decisions save and spend read each other on 2026-04-15)
  assumed: the card names no holiday (holidays)
  cut 2026-03-01
